OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow children's hospital begins
OL,4,Arobot-assisted surgeries
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital in Glasgow has become the
OL,7,Ffirst in the world to have a surgical
OL,8,Frobot dedicated exclusively to helping
OL,9,Fchildren.
OL,11,FThe Royal Hospital for Children in
OL,12,FGlasgow is to use the Versius Plus
OL,13,Frobot for paediatric surgery, after
OL,14,Freceiving a #1.5m donation from a
OL,15,Fcharitable trust.
OL,17,FThe robot can provide greater access
OL,18,Fduring keyhole surgery and will help
OL,19,Fwith operations for complex cancer,
OL,20,Furology, abdominal, thoracic and
OL,21,Fgastrointestinal conditions.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
