OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow children's hospital begins
OL,4,Arobot-assisted surgeries
OL,5,
OL,6,FDoctors at the hospital said the robot
OL,7,Fcan provide enhanced precision while
OL,8,Freducing pain, minimising scarring, and
OL,9,Fgetting patients back to their everyday
OL,10,Flives quicker.
